      "instance_name": "antisemitic_stereotype",
      "label": "Antisemitic Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme relies on the harmful antisemitic stereotype that Jews are responsible for global conspiracies or theft of societal values, such as friendship. This is a well-documented form of antisemitism that falsely attributes blame to Jewish people for negative events or conditions, often rooted in historical persecution and modern conspiracy theories.",
