      "instance_name": "antisemitic_tropes",
      "label": "Antisemitic Tropes",
      "description": "The meme employs antisemitic tropes such as the 'puppet master' imagery (implied by 'stole it and removed it from me') and the false accusation of dual loyalty or control over societal values. These tropes are used to dehumanize and vilify Jewish people, promoting hate and misinformation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
