      "instance_name": "false_victimhood",
      "label": "false expression of victimhood",
      "description": "The Shiba Inu dog's facial expression, characterized by its slightly smug or knowing look, is misused to imply a sense of victimhood or sadness. This expression is falsely attributed to Jews in the text, creating a misleading emotional cue that promotes antisemitic tropes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
